---
// Migration Services Component: Cross-Platform Modernization to Native & KMP
---

<section id="modernization" class="section-container">
  <div class="migration-container-machined">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="engraved-label">[ SPECIALIZED MODERNIZATION & MIGRATIONS ]</span>
        <span class="badge-metal badge-scorched-violet">React Native • Flutter • Hybrid</span>
        <span class="badge-metal badge-anodized-green">Native & KMP Targets</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Cross-Platform to Native & Kotlin Multiplatform</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Break free from JavaScript bridge latency, brittle plugins, and dual maintenance overhead with structured, brownfield migration paths.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 1. Three Modernization Architectural Pathways -->
    <div class="pathways-block">
      <div class="pathways-header">
        <span class="engraved-label">[ THREE MODERNIZATION ARCHITECTURAL PATHWAYS ]</span>
        <h3 class="pathways-title">Select Your Architectural Destination</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="pathways-grid">
        <!-- Pathway 1: Dual Native -->
        <div class="pathway-card">
          <div class="pathway-badge-row">
            <span class="pathway-option-label">Option 01</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-titanium">Platform Purity</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="pathway-name">Dual Native</h4>
          <div class="architecture-pill">
            <span>100% SwiftUI + 100% Jetpack Compose</span>
          </div>
          <p class="pathway-description">
            Pure uncompromised native performance and platform conventions.
          </p>
          <ul class="pathway-details">
            <li>Zero abstraction layer overhead & instant day-one OS API access</li>
            <li>Ideal for hardware-intensive apps, widgets, CarPlay & watchOS</li>
            <li>Native iOS & Android ergonomics adhering to Apple & Google HIG</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pathway 2: Native UI + Shared KMP Core (Recommended) -->
        <div class="pathway-card pathway-featured">
          <div class="pathway-glow"></div>
          <div class="pathway-badge-row">
            <span class="pathway-option-label highlight">Option 02</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-anodized-green">Architectural Sweet Spot</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="pathway-name">Native UI + Shared KMP Core</h4>
          <div class="architecture-pill pill-anodized">
            <span>Native UI (SwiftUI / Compose) + Kotlin Multiplatform Shared Core</span>
          </div>
          <p class="pathway-description">
            Native UX feel with unified business logic, networking, and offline state.
          </p>
          <ul class="pathway-details">
            <li>SwiftUI & Jetpack Compose frontends guarantee 100% native fluidity</li>
            <li>Single source of truth for domain logic, SQLite, encryption & networking</li>
            <li>Eliminates duplicate bug fixes and state drift between platforms</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pathway 3: 100% Compose Multiplatform -->
        <div class="pathway-card">
          <div class="pathway-badge-row">
            <span class="pathway-option-label">Option 03</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-scorched-violet">Maximum Parity</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="pathway-name">100% Compose Multiplatform</h4>
          <div class="architecture-pill">
            <span>Single declarative UI + shared multiplatform codebase</span>
          </div>
          <p class="pathway-description">
            Maximum code parity and rapid feature iteration across platforms.
          </p>
          <ul class="pathway-details">
            <li>Unified Compose declarative UI rendered directly on iOS, Android & Desktop</li>
            <li>Fastest time-to-market for lean product and startup teams</li>
            <li>True native compilation via Kotlin/Native with no runtime webview bridge</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. AI-Accelerated Migration Workflow -->
    <div class="workflow-block">
      <div class="workflow-header">
        <span class="engraved-label">[ AI-ACCELERATED MODERNIZATION WORKFLOW ]</span>
        <h3 class="workflow-title">High-Velocity Transpilation + Staff Architectural Hardening</h3>
        <p class="workflow-subtitle">
          Combining cutting-edge AI tooling with senior human architectural craft to deliver secure, production-grade native migrations in weeks rather than quarters.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-stages-grid">
        <!-- Stage 1: AI-Assisted Transpilation -->
        <div class="stage-card">
          <div class="stage-tag-row">
            <span class="stage-badge">STAGE 01</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-titanium">AST Mapping</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="stage-title">AI-Assisted Transpilation</h4>
          <div class="stage-focus-box">
            <span class="focus-label">FOCUS:</span>
            <span class="focus-value">Codebase transformation & AST mapping</span>
          </div>
          <p class="stage-deliverables-text">
            <strong>Key Deliverables:</strong> Rapid extraction of models, business logic, and UI components from legacy cross-platform code.
          </p>
          <ul class="stage-features-list">
            <li>Automated AST parsing of React Native / Flutter components into Kotlin/Compose models</li>
            <li>High-throughput extraction of TypeScript/Dart business logic without manual boilerplate</li>
            <li>Algorithmic detection of deprecated plugins and native iOS/Android bridge dependencies</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 2: Staff Architectural Hardening -->
        <div class="stage-card stage-card-highlight">
          <div class="stage-tag-row">
            <span class="stage-badge badge-green">STAGE 02</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-anodized-green">Staff Engineering</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="stage-title">Staff Architectural Hardening</h4>
          <div class="stage-focus-box focus-box-green">
            <span class="focus-label">FOCUS:</span>
            <span class="focus-value">Human-led architectural engineering</span>
          </div>
          <p class="stage-deliverables-text">
            <strong>Key Deliverables:</strong> Clean Architecture, MVI state flow, zero-bridge native performance, and comprehensive TDD test suites.
          </p>
          <ul class="stage-features-list">
            <li>Refactoring shared modules into clean Domain, Data, and Presentation boundaries</li>
            <li>Replacing brittle bridges with direct native compilation and memory safety</li>
            <li>Comprehensive unit and UI test automation ensuring zero functional regressions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Specialized Entry Package: Migration Feasibility Assessment -->
    <div class="assessment-block">
      <div class="assessment-card-machined">
        <div class="assessment-header">
          <div class="assessment-badge-row">
            <span class="engraved-label">[ FIXED-SCOPE ENTRY ASSESSMENT ]</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-scorched-violet">Fixed-Scope Package</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-anodized-green">De-Risk Migration</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="assessment-title">Migration Feasibility Assessment</h3>
          <p class="assessment-subtitle">
            Before writing a single line of production code, de-risk your app modernization with an exhaustive architectural investigation, dependency audit, and phased strangler plan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="deliverables-grid">
          <!-- Deliverable 1 -->
          <div class="deliverable-item">
            <div class="deliverable-badge">
              <span class="deliverable-num">01</span>
            </div>
            <div class="deliverable-body">
              <h4 class="deliverable-title">Dependency & Bridge Audit</h4>
              <p class="deliverable-desc">
                Analysis of native plugins, SDK integrations, and bridge bottlenecks.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Deliverable 2 -->
          <div class="deliverable-item">
            <div class="deliverable-badge">
              <span class="deliverable-num">02</span>
            </div>
            <div class="deliverable-body">
              <h4 class="deliverable-title">Architecture Recommendation</h4>
              <p class="deliverable-desc">
                Clear architectural destination selection (Dual Native vs KMP Core vs CMP).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Deliverable 3 -->
          <div class="deliverable-item">
            <div class="deliverable-badge">
              <span class="deliverable-num">03</span>
            </div>
            <div class="deliverable-body">
              <h4 class="deliverable-title">Roadmap & Risk Matrix</h4>
              <p class="deliverable-desc">
                Phased strangler migration plan, effort estimations, and risk mitigations.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Panel for Direct Assessment Request -->
        <div class="assessment-action-panel">
          <div class="action-caption">
            <span class="engraved-label">[ PRAGMATIC MODERNIZATION PATHWAY ]</span>
            <p>Ready to de-risk your app's transition to native or Kotlin Multiplatform?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="action-buttons-group">
            <a href="https://calendar.app.google/u8GcQvp8guvszcKr7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button btn-anodized-green">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
              <span>Request Feasibility Assessment</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/14704061747?text=Hi%20Jesus%2C%20I%20am%20exploring%20migrating%20our%20mobile%20app%20to%20native%2FKMP%20and%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20feasibility%20assessment." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button btn-titanium">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.711 2.598 2.664-.699c.97.549 1.742.883 2.796.883 3.183 0 5.77-2.587 5.77-5.766.001-3.182-2.585-5.769-5.77-5.769zm10.154 5.767c0 5.614-4.57 10.183-10.185 10.183-1.782 0-3.453-.464-4.912-1.272l-5.688 1.492 1.517-5.541c-.896-1.503-1.402-3.256-1.402-5.132 0-5.614 4.568-10.184 10.185-10.184 5.615 0 10.185 4.57 10.185 10.184z"/></svg>
              <span>Chat via WhatsApp</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .migration-container-machined {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #15181e 0%, #0c0e12 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--chamfer-light);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08),
      0 20px 50px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  }

  .badge-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .pathways-block {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pathways-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pathways-title {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  /* Pathways Grid */
  .pathways-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pathway-card {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #181b21 0%, #101217 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--chamfer-light);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05),
      0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .pathway-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .pathway-featured {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #18231d 0%, #0e1511 100%);
    border-color: rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--anodized-green-edge);
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(118, 227, 171, 0.2),
      0 12px 32px -6px rgba(37, 87, 62, 0.35);
  }

  .pathway-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20%;
    right: -20%;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.2) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(40px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .pathway-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .pathway-option-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-engraved);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .pathway-option-label.highlight {
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
  }

  .pathway-name {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .architecture-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: var(--text-laser-white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .architecture-pill.pill-anodized {
    background: rgba(37, 87, 62, 0.25);
    border-color: rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.4);
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
  }

  .pathway-description {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-laser-white);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .pathway-details {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.15rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .pathway-details li {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 14px;
  }

  .pathway-details li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pathways-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Workflow Block Styles */
  .workflow-block {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .workflow-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .workflow-title {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .workflow-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .workflow-stages-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .stage-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #181b21 0%, #101217 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--chamfer-light);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05),
      0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .stage-card-highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #18231d 0%, #0e1511 100%);
    border-color: rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--anodized-green-edge);
  }

  .stage-tag-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .stage-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-engraved);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .stage-badge.badge-green {
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
  }

  .stage-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .stage-focus-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .stage-focus-box.focus-box-green {
    background: rgba(37, 87, 62, 0.25);
    border-color: rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.4);
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
  }

  .focus-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
  }

  .focus-value {
    color: var(--text-laser-white);
  }

  .stage-deliverables-text {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-laser-white);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .stage-deliverables-text strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .stage-features-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.15rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .stage-features-list li {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 14px;
  }

  .stage-features-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .workflow-stages-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Assessment Block Styles */
  .assessment-block {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .assessment-card-machined {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #181b21 0%, #0e1014 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--anodized-green-edge);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(118, 227, 171, 0.2),
      0 16px 40px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  .assessment-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .assessment-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .assessment-title {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .assessment-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .deliverables-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .deliverable-item {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .deliverable-badge {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(37, 87, 62, 0.35);
    border: 1px solid rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.5);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .deliverable-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
  }

  .deliverable-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .deliverable-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .assessment-action-panel {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .action-caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .action-caption p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-laser-white);
  }

  .action-buttons-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .deliverables-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .assessment-action-panel {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .action-buttons-group {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .action-buttons-group .button {
      flex: 1;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
